extends /specs/products/hope/page-structure/structure/templates/structure/layout-tmpl.jade


block content
    .source_info
        p <strong>DO Brief Tile</strong> component can be used on different other components and widgets (eg. slider, newsletter).

    section.source_section
        include /specs/page-structure/helpers/print-json-mixin.jade
        include /specs/page-structure/helpers/print-js-code-mixin.jade

        h2 Usage

        h3 Include template
        +printJsCode('include /specs/ux3/components/card/templates/do-brief-tile/do-brief-tile-tmpl.jade')
        h3 Data
        markdown
            p The following data structure must exist to be able to use do-brief-tile template.
        +printJson({
            "config": {
                "className": [
                    "card"
                ]
            },
            "data": {
                "content": "text"
            }
        })
        markdown
            p You can add custom classes to the container element by passing an array of class names in `"addClassNames": ["...", "..."]`.
    | #{''}

    section.source_section
        h2 DO Blog Tile Example

        markdown

        h3!= data.items[0].title
        +printJson({
            "card": {
                "config": {
                    "classes": "blog featuredCard--dark"
                },
                "header": "Drug & Medical Innovation",
                "body": "<a href=\"#\"> <img class=\"featuredCard__cover\" src=\"/specs/products/hope/components/card/images/hope-fetaured-card-cover.png\" alt=\"\"> <h3 class=\"featuredCard__title\">House Seeks Pause In Cost-Sharing Reduction Litigation (Updated)</h3> </a> <div class=\"featuredCard__details\"> <span class=\"featuredCard__date\">November 22, 2016</span><span class=\"featuredCard__authors\">Timothy Jost</span> </div>"

            }
        })
        .source_example
                .container
                    .row
                        .col-xs-3
                            | !{data.items[0].body}






    | #{''}